      "created_at": "2019-03-19T16:54:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, I hit him with Hypersonic Assault, making it so he can't deal damage, then flip him during this, that means he can't deal damage when he flips, right?</p>\n<p>Or is he no longer a target, and so the card can deal damage?</p>\n<p>Well, rethinking that plan.</p>",
