      "created_at": "2019-03-22T18:25:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Another fun trick is to use A Brother's Sacrifice, then ping Borr up to a ludicrous number of tokens and let him flip. That was how I discovered that if Borr kills another Scion in Phase One, a new Scion enters and immediately takes a full Borr to the face, and if that's enough damage to kill them too, the process continues.&nbsp;</p>",
